<p>You trigger an explosion of your chaos orbs on a target.</p><p>The orbs do no damage but confuse it for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 6, 7, 8, 9</acronym> turns with a confusion power of 10% per orb.</p><p>Your effective spellpower used to overcome the target's mental save is also increased by 10% per orb.</p><p>All your orbs are always spent.</p>